! UNTESTED fragment for externally supplied LHE events with an undecayed PDG 25.
! Requires a validated LHE driver and explicit normalization ledger.
! Z is already decayed in ew_z_decay.mg5; do not force or redecay Z here.
25:mayDecay = on
25:onMode = off
25:onIfMatch = 22 22
HiggsSM:NLOWidths = on
! Physical BR(H->gamma gamma)=0.002270 is an external normalization input,
! never replace it with the conditional forced-decay probability of one.
! Inspect initialized widths/SLHA precedence; no production approval.
